{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","浪潮奔袭"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一条直线上的敌人造成伤害和击退。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向制造一道3格宽的浪潮，对沿途的所有敌人造成280% + 30% ATK伤害，并将其击退2格。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至320% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至330% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至340% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","暗涌"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一名敌人造成较高伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在一名敌人脚下产生水柱，击飞目标并对其造成240% ATK伤害和1.5 + 0.2秒眩晕。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","潮汐之力"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一名友军施加祝福，当其普通攻击时额外对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，选择布阵时距离自己最近的一名友军（相同距离下优先选择更靠近自己身后的友军），为其施加“潮汐之力”祝福。每当受祝福友军的普通攻击命中敌人时，科丝蒂将对这名敌人额外造成一次60% ATK魔法伤害。累计触发9次效果后，该祝福效果将会消失，科丝蒂会在9 − 1秒冷却时间过后再次对该友军施加祝福。该祝福效果无法被驱散。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":128,"end":132,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":90,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至70% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","当原有的祝福目标被击败时，科丝蒂将会重新选择一名距离最近的友军，继续为其施加祝福。施加祝福的时间间隔缩短至5 − 1秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至80% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，技能“潮汐之力”的初始目标存活时进一步提升急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高12点急速。当技能“潮汐之力”的初始祝福目标存活时，自身额外提升2点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高15点急速。当技能“潮汐之力”的初始祝福目标存活时，自身额外提升4点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高18点急速。当技能“潮汐之力”的初始祝福目标存活时，自身额外提升6点急速。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","浪潮祝福"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“浪潮奔袭”还会使沿途友军暂时获得“潮汐之力”的祝福。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","终极技能“浪潮奔袭”还会为沿途所有友军施加临时增益，使这些友军接下来的6次普通攻击也能同等享受到“潮汐之力”的祝福效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","通过本技能施加的“潮汐之力”祝福效果持续次数提高至8次。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每当一名敌人累计受到6次来自技能“潮汐之力”的伤害后，该敌人将立即受到一次“暗涌”的攻击。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","通过本技能施加的“潮汐之力”祝福效果生效次数提高至9次。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“浪潮奔袭”会使敌人的魔抗暂时降低。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","受技能“浪潮奔袭”影响的敌人还会降低20%魔抗，持续10秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","技能“潮汐之力”施加的祝福效果获得增强，持续时间变为永久并使祝福目标提高30点穿透，额外造成魔法伤害的效果每秒至多生效18次。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","蔚蓝"]]}